arent":"147","text":"Diagnostico diferencial DOLOR vs SPCD en demencia","guid":"EydQcKrrQZKOExQcdrVk2g","children":[{"id":"170","parent":"169","text":"Frecuentemente combinacion de ambos","guid":"vCP-ShV7QQqKuqzKpBpHGw","children":[]},{"id":"171","parent":"169","text":"Requiere varias evaluaciones + contexto","guid":"4dTEZwSSRemyLTAFhjQoEA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"172","parent":"0","text":"Evaluacion clinica integral","guid":"Org_nARIRomyjWJv7jXNrQ","children":[{"id":"173","parent":"172","text":"Paciente puede responder","guid":"GbRLxv4WQJmZiI82ScXrwg","children":[{"id":"174","parent":"173","text":"SI -> ESAS + EVA/ENV","guid":"qDXzjSiqRW2zp5a4baNGFA","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"173","text":"NO -> PAINAD + informacion cuidadores","guid":"sOu1igDzQIOAwf_c_B9tzw","children":[]}]},{"id":"176","parent":"172","text":"Caracterizacion objetiva del sintoma","guid":"6Q3iUOJIQMef7vW9eqlZRg","children":[{"id":"177","parent":"176","text":"Calza con enfermedad base","guid":"afx-I62cQP-m_9S84Y5RDw","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"176","text":"Sugiere intercurrencia (ej dolor extremidad + edema -> TVP)","guid":"B0IQrPAZS32IwkGC50j3Jw","children":[]}]},{"id":"179","parent":"172","text":"Plan terapeutico INDIVIDUALIZADO en trayectoria de enfermedad","guid":"CBZuKP-yQ-OZVTzBL-6mOQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"180","parent":"0","text":"Puntos clave de atencion paliativa ambulatoria","guid":"KZAD8M1uQqOpt3CyTNYlOw","children":[{"id":"181","parent":"180","text":"Evalua 5 dimensiones","guid":"eP7HckaqQyK12nKhGvxJ1A","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"180","text":"Competencias complementarias con geriatria","guid":"k0kL6X2dRqiawcWO99yvLg","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"180","text":"Sintomas mas frecuentes dolor + disnea + fatiga","guid":"HJC9pUPiQluM30lexxiEJQ","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"180","text":"Integrar VGI al modelo paliativo","guid":"eNfhfXIYTqyqEpQjngX96w","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"180","text":"Modelo paliativo evoluciono (no solo final de vida)","guid":"-bcO_1PHSNan_nevkwhvbw","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"180","text":"Transiciones de enfermedad determinan cambios de enfoque","guid":"0_Ahoma9Rn6dZoI80kkHaQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"187","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clinicas","guid":"UALmx6E_QhaNWfPvCNLPTw","children":[{"id":"188","parent":"187","text":"Perla 1 Cuidado paliativo NO es sinonimo de final de vida ni de cancer (IAHPC 2018) -> cambiar paradigma","guid":"B_bHjHCMRx2UjzF6_oCIwg","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"187","text":"Perla 2 Proporcion real en Chile paliativo no-oncologico : oncologico = 2-3 : 1 -> derivar IC avanzada, EPOC GOLD D, ERC etapa 5, demencia avanzada","guid":"XkrH5cjoRFayPR5d6-EYeQ","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"187","text":"Perla 3 PREGUNTA SORPRESA me sorprenderia falleciera proximos 12 meses (30 segundos)","guid":"xBqF5zwlTxSAEG5qpBanCg","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"187","text":"Perla 4 3 trayectorias fin de vida distintas (cancer rapido, organo escalonado, demencia gradual) -> orienta intervencion","guid":"3xkuIRbATzOp3x852QWpCw","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"187","text":"Perla 5 DOLOR + DISNEA + FATIGA = triada universal de enfermedad cronica avanzada","guid":"F2yEcE4zTWuD06WiqcUHpQ","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"187","text":"Perla 6 ESAS POSITIVO = puntaje mayor 4 en cualquier item (punto corte simple)","guid":"u_1jI_GwRYSo8tInU9o8SA","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"187","text":"Perla 7 ESAS-r incluye dolor espiritual y preocupaciones financieras (toxicidad financiera real)","guid":"R_pfrHGLQNmIUvBzGL2Zvg","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"187","text":"Perla 8 En trastorno cognitivo usar PAINAD (5 dominios observacionales, puede aplicar familia)","guid":"nuB7_79MQN-ov2Hv3eQi0g","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"187","text":"Perla 9 Distinguir dolor vs SPCD en demencia -> ante duda PROBAR ANALGESIA (paracetamol) antes de psicofarmacos","guid":"OcVPfVCRRLKlPP2QiRPXNQ","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"187","text":"Perla 10 TODOS farmacos paliativos aumentan riesgo CAIDAS -> evaluacion + prevencion obligatoria","guid":"BPbSUsD0Tdmzkbh7XE3q9A","children":[]},{"id":"198","parent":"187","text":"Perla 11 Xerostomia subutilizada como diagnostico (frecuente, deteriora alimentacion y comunicacion)","guid":"pfMXrkwfSZG_lgeT-xaujQ","children":[]},{"id":"199","parent":"187","text":"Perla 12 Aspectos culturales y religiosos NO son detalles -> cambian decisiones clinicas","guid":"jv1cxmIZTxyLHVVLaQMRNQ","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"187","text":"Perla 13 Sobrecarga del cuidador SESGA informacion -> ambos requieren intervencion","guid":"_pQBa-syQU2B0fCLJ7KFhw","children":[]},{"id":"201","parent":"187","text":"Perla 14 Cuidado paliativo es apoyo a paciente Y FAMILIA INCLUIDO DUELO","guid":"1H53jlX-T7Gyq8nuJZRpjQ","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"187","text":"Perla 15 NECPAL v3.1 validada y recomendada por MINSAL Chile (v4.0 en validacion) alternativa SPICT","guid":"muOxUjuzQ_6JkJn5ZIITdg","children":[]}]},{"id":"203","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"cJDiq8cYRqq76Z0VU2NI1A","children":[{"id":"204","parent":"203","text":"Evaluacion M3 (esta clase replicada en M3-Pareja)","guid":"VyVeHyB_ReKjzWsL_kQHww","children":[{"id":"205","parent":"204","text":"Q16 Definicion IAHPC 2018 asistencia activa HOLISTICA + sufrimiento severo relacionado con salud + TODAS las edades + enfermedad grave + no solo final de vida","guid":"NYbuWhzATfK0TNqi1V4ghw","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"204","text":"Q19 Convergencia geriatria-paliativo dominios funcionales + composicion corporal + multimorbilidad + polifarmacia + sindromes geriatricos + VGI","guid":"tyeRkje9TUaA0pYxXlAV9g","children":[]}]},{"id":"207","parent":"203","text":"Evaluacion M4 (AET en demencia avanzada - usar este mapa)","guid":"Kwunu3nSRDyHiu31uFfkhA","children":[{"id":"208","parent":"207","text":"Q11 SNG en demencia avanzada NO mejora calidad de vida + NO previene neumonia aspirativa + SI aumenta UPP + agitacion -> NO indicada rutinariamente (mismo Q20 M2)","guid":"IdFUJxnCQxiUJ4NpuTyMvA","children":[]}]},{"id":"209","parent":"203","text":"Evaluacion Final (transversales AET)","guid":"rKfgJttBR5asyAT9l8ZGyg","children":[{"id":"210","parent":"209","text":"Q17 Juicio de PROPORCIONALIDAD requiere CERTEZA diagnostica y pronostica (sin pronostico solido no se puede limitar/adecuar terapia)","guid":"9yLl_vGtRCSuGp4kr4KcNw","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"209","text":"Q20 AET vs LET preferir ADECUACION (limitar sugiere abandono; adecuar enfatiza reorientar a lo proporcionado al paciente y su trayectoria)","guid":"ahz8829ATbakvMntDwL5AA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"212","parent":"0","text":"Referencias","guid":"RHnn2_dVTGuee8TpGfUmEg","children":[{"id":"213","parent":"212","text":"1. Radbruch L. Redefining Palliative Care (consenso IAHPC). J Pain Symptom Manage 2020;60(4):754-764.","guid":"kyppYZcyTAykAYf0qj8Ttw","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"212","text":"2. Saunders C. Evolution of palliative care. J Royal Society Med 2001;94(9):430-432.","guid":"skCXMBNEQYWRPl92B7Obog","children":[]},{"id":"215","parent":"212","text":"3. Gomez-Batiste X. NECPAL tool development. BMJ Support Palliat Care 2013;3(3):300-308.","guid":"laVLfUymSMyTJ8wY5B3orA","children":[]},{"id":"216","parent":"212","text":"4. Highet G. SPICT validation. BMJ Support Palliat Care 2014;4(3):285-290.","guid":"gYxTboUOQNOQg8vu-otubQ","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"212","text":"5. Bruera E. ESAS. J Palliat Care 1991;7(2):6-9.","guid":"V1carCB_RtOxeDlDPAH9FA","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"212","text":"6. Warden V. PAINAD scale development. JAMDA 2003;4(1):9-15.","guid":"brXVRUz2T3mXhypG4fd5yQ","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"212","text":"7. Lunney JR. Patterns of functional decline at end of life. JAMA 2003;289(18):2387-92.","guid":"7YZYOUc7Rwi6FgxvrMPkdw","children":[]},{"id":"220","parent":"212","text":"8. Murray SA. Illness trajectories and palliative care. BMJ 2005;330(